        "verseNumber": 35,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 17:35",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 17,
        "verse": 35
      },
      {
        "text": "But Ammon stood forth and began to cast stones at them with his sling; yea, with mighty power he did sling stones amongst them; and thus he slew a certain number of them insomuch that they began to be astonished at his power; nevertheless they were angry because of the slain of their brethren, and they were determined that he should fall; therefore, seeing that they could not hit him with their stones, they came forth with clubs to slay him.",
